s/loading","line":15},{"title":"Settings","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/settings","line":17},{"title":"Onboarding","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/onboarding","line":19},{"title":"Privacy","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/privacy","line":21},{"title":"Ratings and reviews","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/ratings-and-reviews","line":21},{"title":"![A sketch of a square containing an arrow pointing to the upper-right corner, suggesting a transition to a new state. The image is tinted orange to subtly reflect the orange in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/95c588c36ab492f99a5a71addbabef12/patterns-launching-thumbnail%402x.png","line":23},{"title":"![A sketch of a waving hand, suggesting a gesture of welcoming. The image is tinted orange to subtly reflect the orange in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d95e8d3a568083918565701d3fe5360e/patterns-onboarding-thumbnail%402x.png","line":25},{"title":"![A sketch of a spinning indeterminate activity indicator, suggesting data loading. The image is tinted orange to subtly reflect the orange in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d3c4485e4c81890440c23e3f64d5511e/patterns-loading-thumbnail%402x.png","line":27},{"title":"Look stunning on every display","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Look-stunning-on-every-display","line":29},{"title":"Typography","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/typography","line":31},{"title":"Adapting your game interface for smaller screens","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Metal/adapting-your-game-interface-for-smaller-screens","line":31},{"title":"Buttons","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/buttons","line":41},{"title":"Images","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/images","line":51},{"title":"Layout","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/layout","line":53},{"title":"Apple Design Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/","line":53},{"title":"Positioning content relative to the safe area","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/positioning-content-relative-to-the-safe-area","line":53},{"title":"In-game menus","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/menus#In-game-menus","line":55},{"title":"Going full screen","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/going-full-screen","line":57},{"title":"![A sketch of a small rectangle in the upper-left quadrant of a larger rectangle, suggesting the position of a user interface element within a window. The image is overlaid with rectangular and circular grid lines and is tinted yellow to subtly reflect the yellow in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0db27821e97ac9613ac0cc103892a10d/foundations-layout-thumbnail%402x.png","line":59},{"title":"![A sketch of a small letter A to the left of a large letter A, suggesting the use of typography to convey hierarchical information. The image is tinted yellow to subtly reflect the yellow in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/30a9c2adbbfa1602133dcfb2f5bfeaab/foundations-typography-thumbnail%402x.png","line":61},{"title":"![A sketch of two outward-pointing arrows arranged in a vertical line extending from the upper-left to the bottom-right, suggesting expansion. The image is tinted orange to subtly reflect the orange in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/335e1e0476ff4830a1a4add07fb016a0/patterns-going-full-screen-thumbnail%402x.png","line":63},{"title":"Enable intuitive interactions","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Enable-intuitive-interactions","line":65},{"title":"Physical controllers","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-controls#Physical-controllers","line":78},{"title":"Touch controls","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-controls#Touch-controls","line":80},{"title":"![A sketch of a D-pad control from a game controller, suggesting gameplay. The image is tinted purple to subtly reflect the purple in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/36867292ccfd45e0f937f522d7e214f7/inputs-game-controls-thumbnail%402x.png","line":82},{"title":"![A sketch of a pointing hand swiping in a curved motion toward the right, suggesting touch interaction with a device. The image is tinted purple to subtly reflect the purple in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ca100cc13bcc2fbb7168bebc1da95af8/inputs-gestures-thumbnail%402x.png","line":84},{"title":"![A sketch of an arrow-shaped pointer, suggesting use of a mouse or trackpad. The image is tinted purple to subtly reflect the purple in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/69b91fbe2b281f7b638d380a3a6aa416/inputs-pointing-devices-thumbnail%402x.png","line":86},{"title":"Welcome everyone","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Welcome-everyone","line":88},{"title":"Apple accessibility technologies","target":"https://developer.apple.com/accessibility/","line":105},{"title":"Unity plug-ins","target":"https://github.com/Apple/UnityPlugins","line":105},{"title":"![A sketch of the Accessibility icon. The image is tinted yellow to subtly reflect the yellow in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8b7b11d06dd958f4e9449f0a5acdadbd/foundations-accessibility-thumbnail%402x.png","line":111},{"title":"![A sketch of two people, suggesting inclusion. The image is tinted yellow to subtly reflect the yellow in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/bbb606721d228138791654cb9f6f426c/foundations-inclusion-thumbnail%402x.png","line":113},{"title":"Adopt Apple technologies","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Adopt-Apple-technologies","line":115},{"title":"Game Center","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-center","line":117},{"title":"GameKit","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/GameKit","line":117},{"title":"Game Center","target":"https://developer.apple.com/game-center/","line":117},{"title":"GameSave","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/GameSave","line":119},{"title":"Playing haptics","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/playing-haptics","line":121},{"title":"Core Haptics","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreHaptics","line":121},{"title":"Playing Haptics on Game Controllers","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreHaptics/playing-haptics-on-game-controllers","line":121},{"title":"Playing audio > visionOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/playing-audio#visionOS","line":123},{"title":"Explore Spatial Audio","target":"https://developer.apple.com/news/?id=fakg1z5b","line":123},{"title":"Technologies","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/technologies","line":125},{"title":"HealthKit","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/HealthKit","line":125},{"title":"![A sketch of the Game Center icon. The image is tinted blue to subtly reflect the blue in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/304edbb771279f5c096419df2cd735fe/technologies-game-center-thumbnail%402x.png","line":127},{"title":"![A sketch of the iCloud icon. The image is tinted blue to subtly reflect the blue in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2b14682c9fa6e5d71042fa722c12bb3f/technologies-icloud-thumbnail%402x.png","line":129},{"title":"![A sketch of an add button, suggesting the purchase of additional digital assets within an app. The image is tinted blue to subtly reflect the blue in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/de58b03338460608880147558546707a/technologies-in-app-purchase-thumbnail%402x.png","line":131},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Resources","line":133},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Related","line":135},{"title":"Game Center","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-center","line":137},{"title":"Game controls","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-controls","line":139},{"title":"Developer documentation","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Developer-documentation","line":141},{"title":"Games Pathway","target":"https://developer.apple.com/games/get-started/","line":143},{"title":"Create games for Apple platforms","target":"https://developer.apple.com/games/","line":145},{"title":"Videos","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Videos","line":147},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/3055294D-836B-4513-B7B0-0BC5666246B0/6C097D36-BE91-4B04-854A-E6264DA86F15/9890_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":149},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/C03E6E6D-A32A-41D0-9E50-C3C6059820AA/2DB746B8-E0B0-4ED1-B250-902DB7A0F3E7/9196_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":151},{"title":"Change log","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Change-log","line":153}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills/skills/hig-platforms/references/designing-for-games.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"0","at":1779618283938},"key":"ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills/skills/hig-platforms/references/designing-for-games.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,null],"size":0,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},

